  "content": "\n\n<h1>进化版 Mekanism 附加内容</h1>\n<p>为&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/evolved-mekanism\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Evolved Mekanism</a>&nbsp;与 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-extras\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism Extra</a>&nbsp;添加联动。</p>\n<h2>功能特性</h2>\n<p>-合金熔炼工厂的额外版本&nbsp;<br>\n-Mekanism 的合金熔炼配方&nbsp;<br>\n-全新等级及对应工厂<br>\n-新型传输器</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1268159/description_2e92895d-cde3-4bb0-aae9-ee21821dc8cc.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1268159/description_d90d3719-fd99-48aa-ac31-a132bc060a6b.gif\" alt=\"\"></h3>\n<h3>等级列表&nbsp;</h3>\n<h4>绝对超频（处理次数12）</h4>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1268159/description_55ba89a9-155b-48ed-a4c7-fa917606cf39.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h4>至尊量子（处理次数14）</h4>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1268159/description_5f9ea371-c011-44fa-a214-9a428b7cc907.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h4>宇宙致密（处理次数16）</h4>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1268159/description_fa2551bc-5a2a-4c67-b2ff-0e73501c0d90.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h4>无限多元（处理次数18）</h4>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1268159/description_97f4c5e0-005b-4924-8884-bc3b4cc4e3cc.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>本模组无法在缺少&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism</a>&nbsp;的情况下运行</p>",
